ay time about 45 minutes.\n- Ink-light pages: white paper, thin lines, and every puzzle works in black and white.\n- Supplies: pencils, scissors, tape, 5 envelopes per team (or folded paper) and a timer.\n- US Letter size; prints on A4 with &quot;Fit to page&quot;.\n- Good for Thanksgiving Day, fall break, family gatherings and classrooms.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nThis is a digital PDF download. Nothing is shipped. After purchase, download the file from your Etsy account (Purchases) or from the email Etsy sends you, then print at home or at a print shop. For personal and classroom use.\n\nThis design was created with AI assistance under the creative direction of the seller.", "rich_description": null, "state": "draft", "creation_timestamp": 1793277618, "created_timestamp": 1793277618, "ending_timestamp": 1803822018, "original_creation_timestamp": 1793277618, "last_modified_timestamp": 1793277722, "updated_timestamp": 1793277722, "state_timestamp": 1793277618, "quantity": 999, "shop_section_id": null, "featured_rank": -1, "url": "https://www.etsy.com/listing/4605581711/thanksgiving-escape-room-for-kids-and", "num_favorers": 0, "non_taxable": false, "is_taxable": true, "is_customizable": false, "is_personalizable": false, "listing_type": "download", "tags": ["thanksgiving escape", "escape room for kids", "kids escape room", "family escape room", "escape room game", "escape room kit", "turkey escape room", "thanksgiving games", "thanksgiving puzzles", "kids thanksgiving", "fall party games", "family game night", "screen free activity"], "materials": ["Digital download", "PDF"], "shipping_profile_id": null, "return_policy_id": 1, "processing_min": null, "processing_max": null, "who_made": "i_did", "when_made": "2020_2026", "is_supply": false, "item_weight": null, "item_weight_unit": null, "item_length": null, "item_width": null, "item_height": null, "item_dimensions_unit": null, "is_private": false, "style": [], "file_data": "1 PDF", "has_variations": false, "should_auto_renew"